      h2.ui.header.centered Consent
      p This document has informed you about participation in the AI social deduction game study. The experiment is run in the form of a contest. That means you will not be directly compensated for your participation in the study. Instead, based on your performance in the games you decide to play, you may be eligible for the chance of winning a prize. More information on the conditions of the contest can be found in the contest rules.
